{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Midtris is mind bending puzzle game where your goal is to place blocks around the center piece and clear layers of perfect squares. Blocks will appear from 4 different directions and game will get harder as you destroy more blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/MidtrisGif1.gif?t=1745065971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 5 different game modes to play. Bombs and other special blocks will spice up the gameplay. Classic mode will offer more traditional block stacking experience without bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete challenges and unlock new block styles. These should offer challenge even for experienced players, but if that is not enough you can compete with other players on global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/MidtrisGif2.gif?t=1745065971\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Midtris is sequel for Centrist with modern rules. Some of the new features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SRS (Wall kicks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Block holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More pieces shown in next block displayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated UI and menu backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New game modes (Midtris &amp; Pentos)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score rework</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591660?t=1745065